a routine medical check-up. He smokes 45
cigarettes a day, and drinks 10 standard
drinks daily. He has a body mass index (BMI)
of 32 kg/m*~.He wears seat-belt almost 60% of
the times when he drives. He is motivated to
follow lifestyle modification advice. Which
