for advice regarding reducing the risk of
Shingles infection after her husband was
diagnosed with ophthalmic shingles 3 days
ago. He had a vesicular rash on his face
involving the eye, for which he was referred
to an ophthalmologist for consultation. She
wants to know if she should be vaccinated.
She clearly remembers that she had chicken
pox at the age of 12 years. Which one of the
following is the most appropriate advice for
