clinic for breast cancer screening. She has
been on combined hormone replacement
therapy (HRT) for the past year.
A mammogram is the only available method
of screening for breast cancer, and because
of the HRT, she is expected to have dense
breast tissue. Which of the following is the
best recommendation for this patient
