department because he found her walking in the
front yard in her nightgown and speaking to
herself incoherently. She is 68 years old and
has an established diagnosis of chronic
obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) made 3
years ago. She has had three episodes of
COPD exacerbation in the past 18 months, for
which she has been hospitalised. On
examination, she looks confused, with a mini
mental status exam (MMSE) score of 24. Which
